  "6e400002-b5a3-f393-e0a9-e50e24dcca9e",
  command,
);
```

### RFID Protocol Rules (Critical - 07 Haziran 2025)
- **Response Command = Request Command + 1**: Bu kural CRİTİK ve değişmez!
- **Pending Command System**: Expected response code ile mapping yapılmalı
- **Frame Processing**: Protocol standardına uygun parsing
- **Timeout Handling**: Response bekleme süreleri optimize edilmiş

```dart
// ✅ DOĞRU - RFID Protocol Command Mapping (CRITICAL!)
const Map<int, int> RFID_COMMAND_MAPPING = {
  0xE0: 0xE1, // Tag Buffer Request → Response
  0x82: 0x83, // Inventory Start Request → Response  
  0x8C: 0x8D, // Inventory Stop Request → Response
  0x6E: 0x6F, // Filter Request → Response
  0x72: 0x73, // Inventory Mode Request → Response
  0x10: 0x11, // Power Set Request → Response
  0x12: 0x13, // Power Get Request → Response
  0xE4: 0xE5, // Buzzer Request → Response
  0x84: 0x85, // Read Tag Request → Response
};

// ✅ DOĞRU - Response Processing
Future<Uint8List?> _sendCommandAndGetResponse(Uint8List command) async {
  final commandCode = command[4];
  final expectedResponseCode = commandCode + 1; // CRİTİK KURAL!
  
  _pendingCommands[expectedResponseCode] = completer;
  // Response geldiğinde expectedResponseCode ile match et
}

// ❌ YANLIŞ - Request code ile response bekleme
_pendingCommands[commandCode] = completer; // Bu YANLIŞ!
```

